/F2 11 Tf
0 -20 Td
(Developed by Edsger Dijkstra, the Banker's Algorithm ensures that the system) Tj
0 -16 Td
(never enters an unsafe state. A state is safe if there exists a safe sequence of) Tj
0 -16 Td
(processes <P1, P2, ... Pn> such that for each Pi, the resources that Pi can still) Tj
0 -16 Td
(request can be satisfied by currently available resources plus resources held) Tj
0 -16 Td
