0 -16 Td
(a detection algorithm using a Wait-For Graph (WFG) or Resource Allocation Graph.) Tj
0 -25 Td
(Recovery techniques include:) Tj
0 -18 Td
(  a) Process Termination: Abort all deadlocked processes, or abort one at a time.) Tj
0 -18 Td
